# 🧮 1️⃣9️⃣ Probability Using Combination

A box contains 5 red and 5 blue balls.

Two balls are selected.

Probability that both are red:

Total ways:

$$
{}^{10}C_2=45
$$

Favourable ways:

$$
{}^5C_2=10
$$

Probability:

$$
\frac{10}{45}
$$

$$
\boxed{\frac29}
$$

