# ⚡ FAST FORMULA CARD

### Permutation

$$
\boxed{
{}^nP_r=\frac{n!}{(n-r)!}
}
$$

### Combination

$$
\boxed{
{}^nC_r=\frac{n!}{r!(n-r)!}
}
$$

### Relationship

$$
\boxed{
{}^nP_r={}^nC_r\times r!
}
$$

### Circular Arrangement

$$
\boxed{(n-1)!}
$$

### Probability

$$
\boxed{
P(E)=\frac{Favourable}{Total}
}
$$

### Complement

$$
\boxed{P(\text{Not E})=1-P(E)}
$$

### Independent AND

$$
\boxed{P(A\cap B)=P(A)P(B)}
$$

